{"0": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-wavetable-play.png?v=583a9e78208e\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Wavetable: ten waveform traces stacked on a dotted floor, receding to the upper right, one traced in bright green with a blue bracket at its left edge, small harmonic bars at the top right, and below them a white filter curve with a red arc over its peak above a grey axis.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "1": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-taffy-play.png?v=aca510d51fbd\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Taffy: a girl in profile blowing a big bubblegum bubble that fills the right half of the screen. The bubble has a wavy blue outline and red glints, and two green strands of gum run from her lips to it.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "2": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-pew-native.png?v=c712bd2f4454\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Pew: an organist in a hat at a two-manual organ with drawbars on top, three keys lit green, a rotary cabinet with red lines spinning round it, green notes rising, smoke from a cigarette, a lamp, a city window with the moon, and a small table with a glass and a candle.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "3": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-elg-play.png?v=5945544f839c\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Elg: a moose&#x27;s head seen from the front with wide blue antlers spread like a crown, a white moon behind it, red northern lights across the top, green breath clouds at the nostrils, navy mountains and pines at the sides and lavender knotwork in the bottom corners.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "4": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-elg-classic.png?v=d22c35f7c22d\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Elg in CLASSIC while a chord plays: the moose under the red aurora, with a small CLASSIC label above the knotwork at the lower left.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "5": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-eva-play.png?v=09e8175402b9\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"EVA screen: an astronaut in a helmet with four meters labelled pressure, freq, oxygen and com\" loading=\"lazy\">", "6": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-eva-oct-native.png?v=5d3387562c1a\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"EVA with orange on page 2: the bottom row is labelled OCT in red with its ticks.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "7": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-mbira-play.png?v=a92d5f962602\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"MBIRA screen: a kalimba with a thumb on a tine and four meters labelled strike, tine, box and buzz\" loading=\"lazy\">", "8": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-mbira-p2-native.png?v=64be6cedfcc2\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"MBIRA on page 2: the labels on the right read RING, DOUBLE, WAH and BUZZ.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "9": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-drift.png?v=c3fb188d559b\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"DRIFT with a chord held: a green wave ridge in front and grey ridges behind it, three blue chevrons over the notes, pink dots on the far ridges, and a white sun under a red arc at the top.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "10": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-ludwig.png?v=412aba1ac505\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"LUDWIG at rest: Beethoven&#x27;s head with white hair and a blue face, red squares around it and a green wave.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "11": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-ludwig-t2.png?v=8156db501d3f\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"LUDWIG&#x27;s T2 page: LUDWIG HAS ITS OWN ENVELOPE, then a line for each encoder in its colour (HAMMER with SHIFT: RELEASE, STRETCH with ATTACK, SUSTAIN with TUNING, TONE with PEDAL) and the two push rules at the bottom.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "12": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-windwood.png?v=aed93e776060\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Windwood: a hair dryer blowing into the mouthpiece of a clarinet, a saw, a vent and a microphone at the bell.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "13": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-pinboard.png?v=7415974f3711\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"PINBOARD on the MELTDOWN pattern: the name in red over a bracketed eight by eight board with white, green and red pins, 63 at the right, a blue wave, a green filter curve with a small peak, a round tilt dial and a white trapezoid.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "14": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-pinboard-edit.png?v=7b8b7ae436f2\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"PINBOARD in edit mode: sources down the left, destinations across the top and thin cables to the pins, a white square round the red pin where OSC 3 meets FLT, and on the right OSC 3 &gt; FILTER over OFF, FULL, GENTLE and INVERT, with INVERT framed, and ORANGE: DONE.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "15": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-vox-native.png?v=50f4b779de6e\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"VOX with a C major chord held and speech coming in: WAVE SAW, FORMANT +5 ST, RESPONSE 50% and AIR 25% at the top, lavender band bars with white caps, a dim dashed green line for the voice as sung and a solid green line moved right of it with a small arrow, the blue saw wave on the left, three blue dots under the baseline, C MAJ at the bottom left and BANDS 20, HOLD OFF at the bottom right.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "16": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-vox-p2-native.png?v=5f8db5147c53\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"VOX page 2: blue bars for the bands with 8, 12, 16, 20 and 24 below and 20 underlined, HOLD set to OFF on the right, and the line LAST VOWEL HOLDS.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "17": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-vox-input-native.png?v=d65e7ec7ba40\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"VOX&#x27;s T2 input page: INPUT, GAIN 0 DB in blue and MIC at the top, a green level bar short of the red clip mark, the note C#3 with +49 cents and 285 Hz, and DELAY 0 MS.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "18": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-snap-native.png?v=f3f0f2e5ca0f\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"SNAP while a voice sings over a held C major chord: SPEED 1 MS, HUMAN 50%, FORMANT 0 ST and a VOICES slider set to the middle at the top, note lines with a thin white pitch line and a thick green line stepping between notes, two blue dashed lines for the key voices, the note G# over a cents needle on the left, and TARGET AUTO CHROM and RANGE MID along the bottom.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "19": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-snap-p2-native.png?v=929a11f5d547\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"SNAP page 2: TARGET with AUTO lit, CHROM and KEYS, and the line OP-1 SCALE OR ALL 12 NOTES; RANGE below with MID lit between LOW and HIGH, and 100 HZ UP 13 MS.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "20": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-snap-input-native.png?v=b789d5dce8dd\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"SNAP&#x27;s T2 input page: INPUT, GAIN 0 DB in blue and MIC at the top, a green level bar short of the red clip mark, the note D3 with +0 cents and 294 Hz, DELAY 13 MS and VOICED 99%.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "21": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-reactor-native.png?v=f7392a5646f9\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"REACTOR with a note held: a power plant with steam rising from the cooling tower, four rods in the reactor vessel, and a control desk with blue, green, white and red dials and gauges.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "22": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-strum-native.png?v=20037d5e2a03\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Strum holding a chord: a guitar neck across the top with blue and green dots at the 10th to 12th frets, and four panels below: G in blue, V in green, the eighths pattern as white down and up arrows, and 10 in red seven-segment digits.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "23": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-strum-p2-all-native.png?v=240d46f28040\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Strum with page 2 on for blue, green and white: the tabs read SWING, HUMAN and SPREAD with their values, and the arrows in the white panel are shifted and leaning.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "24": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-moai-native.png?v=fdfbae7015a4\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Moai holding a chord: the moai of Ahu Tongariki at dusk, drawn in red, blue and white lines, with the filter ridges on the left of the horizon and the contour island on the right.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "25": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-moai-panel-native.png?v=05cda11642b5\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Moai&#x27;s panel view: oscillators, mixer, modifiers and analog sections with small dials; four are lit, and CUT, EMP, AMT and DEC with their values sit above the encoder dials.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "26": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-moai-osc-native.png?v=0bae1aa2b421\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Moai&#x27;s oscillator view: rows 1, 2, 3 and M with range, wave, frequency and volume dials, and a scope with a blue sine on the right.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "27": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-moai-filter-native.png?v=31cae5ce56ba\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Moai&#x27;s filter view: a blue filter curve on a grid with 100, 1K and 10K marks, and CUT, EMP, AMT and FBK values below.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "28": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-moai-analog-native.png?v=8024700e0b14\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Moai&#x27;s analog view: four overlapping waves on a scope, and DET, DRF, DRV and SAT values below.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "29": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-amp-native.png?v=62a56ded2f60\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Amp: a small combo amp with four dials labelled VOL, COMP, TONE and DRIVE, the grille lit by the signal and a dotted red input line coming in from the jack.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "30": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-amp-voice-native.png?v=d8e8430abbdc\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Amp with blue pushed: the first dial reads VOICE and a blue box on the left shows a small amp head and cabinet, labelled CRUNCH.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "31": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-amp-tuner-native.png?v=160e7812958a\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Amp T2 tuner with GAIN +6 DB in blue at the top right, reading D#3, 1 cent flat, with the needle at the green centre.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "32": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-oxbow-native.png?v=33ee260dc59f\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Oxbow at rest: a geometric ox head facing forward with blue horns, two red birds and a green bell. Arc gauges in the corners show TONE, SHAPE, CONTOUR and WARMTH, with RES, FILTER and DRIVE in grey below the first three.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "33": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-oxbow-controls-native.png?v=5ad974af186e\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Oxbow with green pushed: FILTER LP12 is lit in green and SHAPE is dimmed, and the green arc shows the filter type.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "34": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-sid-native.png?v=cc2fece1c834\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"SID screen showing saw mode, Voices 49, Cutoff 97 and Res 25.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "35": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-monolit-native.png?v=1b2762695c75\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"MONOLIT holding a chord: a dark monolith on a night horizon with a pale moon, a green ridge over it that is wide and open and ends in a red tip, blue rings on the ground around its base and a white dashed arc for the contour.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "36": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-monolit-p2-native.png?v=687a833e0508\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"MONOLIT on page 2: the same monolith scene with three readouts at the top right: Body in blue, Vel in green and Age in white, each with its value.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "37": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-outatime-native.png?v=fb54028d6562\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"outatime holding a chord: the car on the road with a fire trail behind it, the speedometer at 18 mph, the time circuits at 1985, 1989 and 1985, and the flux capacitor with power at 0.31.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "38": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-outatime-p2-native.png?v=d22ab78dad8f\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"outatime on page 2: the tabs read Spread 28 in blue, Tone 29 in green and Flux 27 in white, over the same time machine.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "39": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-bloodmoon-native.png?v=cc12df3ef991\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Bloodmoon: a gothic cathedral under a red moon, with BLOOD and ECLIPSE values on the left and HAUNTING and MOONRISE on the right.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "40": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-supersaw.png?v=4ace5603d0e1\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Supersaw: a chainsaw with four encoder dials below.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "41": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-fmbell.png?v=b799e81acf39\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"FM Bell screen: a line-art bell with green strike rings either side and one dial in each corner.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "42": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-granular-play.png?v=256108f86092\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Granular playing: the recording along the top with a blue play-head arrow, four dotted waves in the knob colours with grain marks on the blue one, and POS 0.07S, SIZE 99MS, SPRAY 137MS and DENS 1.8X along the bottom.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "43": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-granular-browser-native.png?v=85bcf21bb7f2\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Granular&#x27;s sample browser: the sampler presets with Leader picked, Load on white and Back on orange.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "44": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-granular-pitch.png?v=0204552f168c\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Granular with PITCH and SHAPE open: the recording along the top with a blue arrow, four dotted waves, and PITCH 0ST, SHAPE HANN, SPRAY 137MS and DENS 1.8X along the bottom.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "45": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-granular-gain-native.png?v=142ceb620c9e\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Granular with orange on page 2: the fourth label reads GAIN, with its value.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "46": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-aether-native.png?v=f0e7a70a0aac\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Aether satellite dish and radio signals responding to a held note and tilt.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "47": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-aether-p2-native.png?v=e56650713633\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Aether page 2: the sliders for dead zone, tilt range and vibrato rate are lit; ORBIT, FORM and SPACE dim, DEPTH unchanged.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "48": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-iter-play.png?v=76767f27e1dc\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Iter lab screen: flasks, gauges and tubes\" loading=\"lazy\">", "49": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-mixtur.png?v=7f7dd0355264\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Mixtur screen: a ladder of strings with four coloured, and divider values A to D\" loading=\"lazy\">", "50": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-mixtur-p2.png?v=80ce080436ce\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Mixtur page 2: two formant curves and the first formant frequency, F1 444 Hz\" loading=\"lazy\">", "51": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-arc.png?v=cdd964773b63\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Arc while a chord plays: two carbon electrodes with a blue looping phase portrait around the gap and four encoder dials below.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "52": "<img src=\"manual/img/synth-arc-p2.png?v=7381ee52174b\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Arc page 2: the blue dial has a ring, the second lamp&#x27;s ratio 1:1 shows top right and a faint loop circles the carbons.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "53": "<img src=\"manual/img/opus-dimension.png?v=6d415c8fa1d9\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"dimension: the waveform list on the left with saw selected, a blue loop in the middle and the resonance in red on the right.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "54": "<img src=\"manual/img/opus-dx.png?v=9199141bc5e0\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"dx with OPUS EP loaded: the voice number and name at the top, part tabs from VCE to OP6, algorithm 5 as six numbered operator boxes, and ALGORITHM 5 on the right over a red value bar.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "55": "<img src=\"manual/img/drumplus-browse.png?v=70bd3e9e334e\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Drum type list with DBOX, DRUM and DRUM+ selected\" loading=\"lazy\">", "56": "<img src=\"manual/img/drumplus-t1.png?v=819c2089b927\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"drum+ play page for pad 8 with pitch, pitch envelope, retrigger and drive\" loading=\"lazy\">", "57": "<img src=\"manual/img/drumplus-t1-shift.png?v=50b6bef5287c\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"drum+ play page with Shift held: fine, pitch time, rate, volume\" loading=\"lazy\">", "58": "<img src=\"manual/img/drumplus-t2.png?v=3c5de35647d1\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"drum+ envelope page: attack, decay, release and cutoff\" loading=\"lazy\">", "59": "<img src=\"manual/img/drumplus-t2-shift.png?v=dd108807a105\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"drum+ envelope page with Shift held: velocity to pitch, humanize, resonance, velocity to cutoff\" loading=\"lazy\">", "60": "<img src=\"manual/img/drum-gin-play.png?v=684b50e79166\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Native Gin Play: A and B bottles pour into a glass; Morph 4, Pitch 44, Decay 56 and Balance 0.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "61": "<img src=\"manual/img/drum-gin-advanced.png?v=b4e67fbda135\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Native Gin Advanced Tone page: Cabasa, Edit A, Morph 4, Sine wave, Pitch 415 Hz; Exit, Prev, Next and Name.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "62": "<img src=\"manual/img/opus-sim.png?v=5c985489aaf5\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"sim: a short green waveform at the top right and a glass box in green lines with four wireframe solids on its floor: three round ones and a boxy one in red.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "63": "<img src=\"manual/img/mixer-fx2-native.png?v=bcf2f67e6423\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"The FX2 page with the source set to AUX and the output on STEREO MASTER.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "64": "<img src=\"manual/img/mixer-aux-native.png?v=61743a2c1407\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Mixer T1 with FX2 on AUX: a small send knob under each track&#x27;s pan, each set to a different amount.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "65": "<img src=\"manual/img/master-lfo-native.png?v=f618bde99261\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Master LFO: four rows in blue, green, white and red, each with a lane, a rate, an amount, an FX target and a waveform; the blue LFO is turned up.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "66": "<img src=\"manual/img/master-lfo-shift-native.png?v=845ed02b864b\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Master LFO with Shift held: per row the phase offset, smoothing, polarity (+ on LFO 1, +- on the others) and FREE for the sync.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "67": "<img src=\"manual/img/master-lfo-off-native.png?v=a638a0041a70\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Master LFO switched off: the four rows dim, with OFF where each amount was.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "68": "<img src=\"manual/img/strip-synth.png?v=45fda89bdb04\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"SYNTH STRIP switched on: a white response curve with a small high-pass arrow on the left, a gentle EQ bump with a ring at 1 kHz, the drive curve top right, the level bar down the right edge, and HPF 22 HZ, LPF OFF, FREQ 1.0K and GAIN +2.0 DB along the bottom.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "69": "<img src=\"manual/img/strip-off.png?v=437392bdf409\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"SYNTH STRIP switched off: a big green OFF over a flat dim line, and HPF OFF, LPF OFF, FREQ 1.0K and GAIN 0 DB along the bottom.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "70": "<img src=\"manual/img/strip-shift.png?v=49beb8177deb\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"SYNTH STRIP with Shift held: LEVEL 0 DB, ON, Q 0.71 and DRIVE 0% along the bottom.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "71": "<img src=\"manual/img/strip-tape.png?v=10b71725fb73\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"The tape strip page on track 2: the track squares at the top with track 2 filled and boxed, the response line with the high-pass at 1.9 kHz, and HPF 1.9K, LPF OFF, FREQ 1.0K, GAIN 0 DB along the bottom.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "72": "<img src=\"manual/img/fx-rackverb-native.png?v=7532eb93f081\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"rackverb on VERB I, drawn as a rack unit with screws in the side ears: VERB I in bold slanted letters with three blue lines, program 14 in red seven-segment digits with 1.0 SEC MEDIUM WARM under it, blue Feedback 0%, green Cutoff 10.0K and white Mix 50% knobs, and along the bottom PROG 14/63, a two-row L and R level meter lit green most of the way, and AUTH in red.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "73": "<img src=\"manual/img/fx-rackverb-page2.png?v=e4e31b4559a3\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"rackverb with all three knobs on page 2: blue Size 100%, green Mode AUTH and white Unit VERB I, each with its page-1 value (0%, 10.0K, 50%) small in grey underneath, and the bottom strip with PROG 14/63, the L and R meter and AUTH.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "74": "<img src=\"manual/img/fx-ente-native.png?v=aad398664f36\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"ENTE pumping on the beat: a white rubber duck with a red bill, squashed low and wide, red squeak lines at its bill, a tall green bar on the right, and along the bottom THRESH -36 DB, RATIO 8.0:1, RELEASE 151 MS and SOURCE BEAT 1/4.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "75": "<img src=\"manual/img/fx-washer-play.png?v=b0126f25b043\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Washer screen: a washing-machine drum with three socks, blue turning arrows and a red sock outside\" loading=\"lazy\">", "76": "<img src=\"manual/img/fx-snowglobe-play.png?v=bf9ffd19fb57\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Snowglobe screen: a snow globe with a cabin, sparkles and a wind-up key\" loading=\"lazy\">", "77": "<img src=\"manual/img/fx-stutter-play.png?v=fad270d57aff\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"STUTTER screen: a film projector with four knob rings and the last slices as bars\" loading=\"lazy\">", "78": "<img src=\"manual/img/fx-stutter-parts-native.png?v=7e0b7c38ef4f\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"STUTTER with blue pushed: the projector, and the blue Rate ring showing Parts.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "79": "<img src=\"manual/img/fx-hail-play.png?v=693a4cb345c3\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"HAIL screen: a thread between two pulleys with grains as beads and four readouts\" loading=\"lazy\">", "80": "<img src=\"manual/img/fx-hail-secondary-native.png?v=a4660bff86a3\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"HAIL native OP-1 screen with the blue Pitch, green Mix and white Space rows and their meters.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "81": "<img src=\"manual/img/fx-hail-frozen-native.png?v=f383c2503b8f\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"HAIL frozen: the grain machine, with FROZEN in red under DENSITY.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "82": "<img src=\"manual/img/fx-crush-native.png?v=cdfbc719ac83\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Crush screen showing Bits 6, Rate 8.0, Drive 0 and Mix 20.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "83": "<img src=\"manual/img/fx-warble-native.png?v=b8f0af329be3\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Warble screen showing Rate 52, Depth 57, Tone 79 and Mix 20.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "84": "<img src=\"manual/img/fx-plate-native.png?v=b0e0149765e4\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Plate screen showing Decay 49, Tone 59, Pre 32 and Mix 20.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "85": "<img src=\"manual/img/fx-sister-native.png?v=209f68700fc9\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"SISTER with Space 59: a gothic nave in green line art with a veiled nun in front of a green rose window, three candles of falling height on the left, Space in blue at the top left, Mix in red with a bar at the right, and Voice and Swell at the bottom.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "86": "<img src=\"manual/img/fx-sister-key-native.png?v=e167ab04ae43\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"SISTER with green pushed: the cathedral, with KEY F3 in green bottom left.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "87": "<img src=\"manual/img/fx-tape-play.png?v=be2ed53ddccf\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Tape echo screen: a tape loop over erase, record and play heads\" loading=\"lazy\">", "88": "<img src=\"manual/img/fx-tape-p2-native.png?v=e938cd490267\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Tape on page 2: 3 HEADS at the top left, two extra blue play heads next to the record head, a green mix bar on the right edge and 1/4. in a white box where the white dial was.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "89": "<img src=\"manual/img/fx-clouds-play.png?v=4328244deb1f\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Clouds screen: a horizontal buffer line with a red mark where new sound comes in, a blue hook for Position and four dials.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "90": "<img src=\"manual/img/fx-clouds-p2-native.png?v=c7bb85904f42\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Clouds on page 2: the buffer line, and the blue, green and white dials each with a ring.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "91": "<img src=\"manual/img/fx-reverb-native.png?v=37c6242d1b96\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Reverb skull and fire artwork with Time, Tone, Diffusion and Mix in knob order.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "92": "<img src=\"manual/img/fx-palme.png?v=129f1c695d2b\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Palme screen: a palm-leaf loudspeaker with strings, the root C3 and four small dials\" loading=\"lazy\">", "93": "<img src=\"manual/img/fx-palme-p2-native.png?v=fdd44755fc3f\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Palme on page 2: the leaf, with METAL, DAMP and SPRD dials ringed on the right.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "94": "<img src=\"manual/img/fx-in_a_room-native.png?v=403e5df20a22\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"In a room before capture, showing Size, Shape, Erode and Mix.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "95": "<img src=\"manual/img/fx-in_a_room-p2-native.png?v=857fef542756\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"In a room page 2 with Loop, Absorb, Crossfade and Mix.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "96": "<img src=\"manual/img/opus-chorus.png?v=19c1c15ff1cb\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"chorus: rainbow-coloured sine waves crossing the screen, CHOR-01 and a sweep symbol at the top, a scale from -4 to +4 below.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "97": "<img src=\"manual/img/seq-hold-native.png?v=fc86bf8be52f\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"HOLD playing a held C-E-G drone: three full rings in blue, green and white, a red playhead hand, STEP, LEN and SWING in the corners and PLAY top right.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "98": "<img src=\"manual/img/seq-hold-multi.png?v=7a01552c546d\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"HOLD in MULTI: four rings, the inner one dim and empty, TRACK 2 above STEP 1 on the left, LEN 16 and SWING 0 on the right.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "99": "<img src=\"manual/img/latch-native.png?v=e276365a859d\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"The synth envelope page with latch on: a slim keyboard strip at the top, three latched keys in pink and LATCH 3.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "100": "<img src=\"manual/img/lineclock-native.png?v=8a736b6ab240\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Line clock following at 120.0 BPM, with the pulse lamp, four beat dots, the input bar against its trigger mark, and RATE, START, LEVEL and EDGE in the encoder colours.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "101": "<img src=\"manual/img/keyvel-native.png?v=7121b019a180\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"KEY VELOCITY page: VELOCITY OFF in blue, SENSITIVITY 8 in green, CURVE LINEAR in white and MIN VELOCITY 16 in orange.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "102": "<img src=\"manual/img/trigguard-native.png?v=d72100801921\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"TRIGGER GUARD page: TRIG. GUARD ON in blue, WINDOW MS 50 in green, WINDOWS PER NOTE in white and HOLD RELEASE ON in orange.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "103": "<img src=\"manual/img/seq-composer-play.png?v=33427ab02cc9\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Composer&#x27;s PLAY page with the lead latched: the top line shows LEAD, the page tabs, the ringed play mark, the song form as blocks with the playing one lit, and the section and bar. Below, the eight bars of the lead as a moving line with the playhead, then Style, Density, Vary and Tension with bars and their pushes.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "104": "<img src=\"manual/img/seq-composer-song.png?v=e6ff0d439120\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Composer&#x27;s SONG page with the bass part playing: the bass as bars rising from the floor, then Role BASS, Key A, Dynamics 50% and Song SONG, with pips for the choices.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "105": "<img src=\"manual/img/seq-composer-shift-native.png?v=340d2c7714da\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Composer with Shift held: SHIFT lit in the top line, Key from MANUAL, Swing STYLE, Length STYLE and Next -, with the pushes Lock, Rhythm, Chords and Jump.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "106": "<img src=\"manual/img/seq-composer-drums.png?v=250a5acfe033\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Composer on the drum page playing deep house: one row each for kick, clap, rim, closed hat and open hat over 16 steps, the playhead and the step playing in red, above Style, Density, Vary and Fills.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "107": "<img src=\"manual/img/seq-composer-drums-pads.png?v=0469bc7c542f\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Composer&#x27;s PADS page: the 24 keys as a keyboard with each drum voice&#x27;s short name on its key and the closed hat in red, above Voice CL HAT, Pad KEY 4, Kit CUSTOM and Map 1 MOVED.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "108": "<img src=\"manual/img/seq-trail-play.png?v=b17b8c7425c5\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Trail&#x27;s PLAY page while a latched phrase plays: the phrase as a white line with a square dot per step and the playing step in red, two earlier versions of it in fading grey below, and Rate, Density, Character and Evolve with their values, bars and the pushes Page, New, Notes and Undo.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "109": "<img src=\"manual/img/seq-trail-tune.png?v=2d626c346b25\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Trail&#x27;s TUNE page: Root C, Scale MINOR, Range 2 OCT and Gate 65%, with pips or a bar under each value and the pushes Page, New, Notes and Undo.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "110": "<img src=\"manual/img/seq-trail-shift.png?v=8c73eb6e8ef6\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Trail with Shift held: SHIFT lit in the top line, Key from LOCAL, Swing 50%, Gate 65% and Steps 16, with the pushes Lock, Rhythm, Develop and Answer.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "111": "<img src=\"manual/img/seq-quant-native.png?v=36b981e242ed\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"QUANT playing a two-bar loop: white notes on a piano roll with grey marks where they were played, an orange playhead, and BARS 2, GRID 1/16, STRENGTH 100% and PLAY on the right.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "112": "<img src=\"manual/img/tool-randomiser-native.png?v=591234eb413d\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Randomiser panel: RANDOM in a box over a line drawing of a conveyor machine.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "113": "<img src=\"manual/img/tool-randomiser-back-native.png?v=bf70550bfcaa\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Randomiser panel: MODNAR in a box over the machine drawing.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "114": "<img src=\"manual/img/chord-play-degree.png?v=e64ebca6b40f\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Chord page showing chord C, numeral I, a keyboard with the chord lit and four settings along the bottom\" loading=\"lazy\">", "115": "<img src=\"manual/img/chord-page-b-native.png?v=e712d0e87960\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Chord page B: voicing inv 1 with bass on, strum 1/24 going up, human off, shape even, drum chords off.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "116": "<img src=\"manual/img/chord-voiceplus-native.png?v=0afcd7627a1e\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Chord page A while C is held. VOICE+ in the corner says page B isn&#x27;t at its defaults.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "117": "<img src=\"manual/img/chord-play-step.png?v=8532b2194f17\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Chord page in step mode with progression tabs I, V, vi, IV, and POP, the group, under the progression\" loading=\"lazy\">", "118": "<img src=\"manual/img/maiko-scale-on.png?v=10288901cba1\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Scale view under play mode and portamento: a keyboard with green dots and hollow rings, blue root triangles, KEY C and the red SCALE lane M.MINOR\" loading=\"lazy\">", "119": "<img src=\"manual/img/scale-mode-native.png?v=08f6d2fe0539\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"The scale view with Shift held: C blues in Snap mode, with SNAP in red after the SCALE label.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "120": "<img src=\"manual/img/midiseq-native.png?v=c22e48b9415e\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"The empty MIDI sequencer view: track 1 at 1.1.1, the time, input and output I \u2192 I, four lanes and the playhead.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "121": "<img src=\"manual/img/midiseq-quant-native.png?v=a33f4e405bc2\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"The MIDI sequencer view with the Q16 quantize grid selected.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "122": "<img src=\"manual/img/seq-euclid.png?v=9b269a659941\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Euclid page with six slot rings, a big ring with 12 green hits, and steps, hits and rotation values\" loading=\"lazy\">", "123": "<img src=\"manual/img/seq-euclid-p2.png?v=cdda9fba6d3a\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Euclid page 2 for slot 3 with rate 1/16\" loading=\"lazy\">", "124": "<img src=\"manual/img/dots-rec-notes.png?v=7408b03d4714\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Dots page in record mode: slot tabs 1 to 6, REC, a row of green steps and a cursor\" loading=\"lazy\">", "125": "<img src=\"manual/img/dots-play.png?v=849cf2aa578b\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Dots with recording off and the slot running\" loading=\"lazy\">", "126": "<img src=\"manual/img/seq-c64arp-current.png?v=3268e6db2d69\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"C64arp main page: Major table, rate 1/16, one octave and Hold off.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "127": "<img src=\"manual/img/seq-c64arp-edit-native.png?v=53d02398d5c3\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"C64arp edit page with Step, Offset, Dwell and Gate.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "128": "<img src=\"manual/img/lfo-q1.png?v=350ba8ea3173\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Quad LFO page with four rows, one per LFO in blue, green, white and red: a dot, a slider, the speed (0.31, 0.95, 2.67, 8.19), the amount and, on the right, the wave.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "129": "<img src=\"manual/img/lfo-q1-shift.png?v=a445426ed6ba\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Quad LFO Shift table: each row shows the type VOIC, smoothing 0, polarity +- and FREE (not synced).\" loading=\"lazy\">", "130": "<img src=\"manual/img/lfo-pond-native.png?v=72fb7a865662\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Pond LFO: four small bars at the top left, a dotted trail across two axes, and SPEED, CHAOS, AMOUNT and TARGET with their values along the bottom.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "131": "<img src=\"manual/img/opus-matrix.png?v=850127c26138\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"matrix: one row on the left going to ENG, an add place under it, and a green sine at 125 BPM on the right with RATE, SYNC, TRIG and POL below.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "132": "<img src=\"manual/img/seq-oracle-native.png?v=2e6c953e85d1\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Oracle: four rows of dot figures, the Judge ACQUISITIO bottom left with HOLD and a red dot, and the lane notes and rate bottom right.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "133": "<img src=\"manual/img/seq-peal.png?v=998ff7dbd1b2\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Peal with five bells ringing: PLAIN BOB, DOUBLES, rate 1/16, call 0 %, rough 0 %, the rows of the method on the left and the row count 2/120.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "134": "<img src=\"manual/img/undo-popup.png?v=3ff733d0d333\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Tape screen with the UNDO popup: a cassette on a red tile and the word UNDO\" loading=\"lazy\">", "135": "<img src=\"manual/img/sampler-zoom.png?v=8fc147712894\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"The synth sampler zoomed in, with markers and the zoom level at the top left\" loading=\"lazy\">", "136": "<img src=\"manual/img/sampler-fit.png?v=0ad8402f94cf\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"The fit panel: bar count, tempo, four bar cells, keep pitch or tape, and fit\" loading=\"lazy\">", "137": "<img src=\"manual/img/tape-markers2.png?v=ab64893f4c25\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Tape screen with a recorded track and two green marker ticks\" loading=\"lazy\">", "138": "<img src=\"manual/img/samplerplus-t1-native.png?v=83e25a3eb8b3\" width=\"752\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Sampler+ ACIDRONE waveform, forward mode, Crossfade, Pitch envelope, Sync and Drive.\" loading=\"lazy\">", "139": "<img src=\"manual/img/samplerplus-browser-native.png?v=ec0637fd25e0\" width=\"752\" heig